<title>BELGIUM: Finnish markka to trade in relatively narrow range.</title>
<headline>Finnish markka to trade in relatively narrow range.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland will aim for the markka to trade in a relatively narrow range in the European Union's Exchange Rate Mechanism, a senior Bank of Finland official said on Saturday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are aiming for something relatively narrow,&quot; Bank of Finland director Matti Vanhala said.  </p>
<p>Asked how he believed the markka would develop in the ERM, he told Reuters: &quot;We would expect that it would move in a relatively narrow range.&quot;</p>
